* define a 5-element array with data: 10, 20, 30, 40, 50
      ORIG 1000
START ENT1 0
LOOP  LDA ARR,1
      INC1 1
      CMP1 SIZE
      JL LOOP
      HLT 

ARR   CON 10      first element (index 0)
      CON 20      second element (index 1)
      CON 30      third element (index 2)
      CON 40      fourth element (index 3)
      CON 50      five element (index 4)
SIZE  CON 5       keep track of the total count
      END START
